WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.200
[A door bangs open.]
PARTY. NOW.

00:00.120 --> 00:00.870
Halloween night.

00:01.080 --> 00:02.650
The party's already started…

00:02.500 --> 00:03.810
and my essay's due at midnight.

00:04.180 --> 00:06.610
Even my Blackboard dresses up for Halloween…

00:06.460 --> 00:07.130
with Glaze.

00:06.520 --> 00:07.480
[A drop of Glaze splashes onto the laptop.]

00:07.740 --> 00:08.300
Pumpkin Patch

00:07.740 --> 00:08.450
Pumpkins…

00:08.300 --> 00:09.120
or graveyard?

00:08.300 --> 00:09.570
Graveyard

00:09.660 --> 00:10.970
I'm typing fast…

00:09.833 --> 00:10.833
A Glaze Halloween: Due at Midnight

00:10.820 --> 00:11.870
typos everywhere.

00:12.240 --> 00:13.990
Glaze Writer fixes them as I type…

00:14.100 --> 00:14.850
on my laptop.

00:14.260 --> 00:15.300
on your device

00:15.200 --> 00:15.630
MLA?

00:16.090 --> 00:18.000
One switch: real pages…

00:18.080 --> 00:18.770
heading fixed.

00:19.080 --> 00:19.710
Need a source?

00:20.100 --> 00:21.550
Paste a DOI…

00:21.400 --> 00:21.810
cited.

00:21.840 --> 00:22.720
BOO!

00:22.040 --> 00:22.470
AH!

00:22.830 --> 00:23.990
Deleted the wrong paper?

00:24.040 --> 00:25.780
Deleted? 30 days in Trash

00:24.340 --> 00:25.330
It waits in Trash.

00:25.680 --> 00:27.030
Every word's mine…

00:27.060 --> 00:28.450
and I'm still on time.

00:27.680 --> 00:29.500
[A clock ticks to 11:59. A tap on the trackpad.]
Submitted · 11:59 PM

00:28.500 --> 00:29.983
[She runs out with a broom, cackling.]

00:29.460 --> 00:30.170
Mwahaha!

00:30.020 --> 00:31.330
Glaze.

00:30.333 --> 00:34.133
New in Glaze 4.0: Glaze Writer + Documents for Blackboard Ultra · Free
frostdev.io/glaze · Chrome · Safari · Firefox

00:31.610 --> 00:31.910
Free.

00:32.320 --> 00:33.070
Happy Halloween.
